=== ascii-case-with-single-bracket-members-escapes-and-ranges
## With core.ignorecase an escaped letter and a single bracket member are compared as written with the folded
## name (so upper-case ones match nothing), while a range also takes the other case.
--- .gitignore
[A]r
[a]s
x[!a]
r[A-C]
q\ay
--- paths
Ar
ar
As
as
xA
xa
xb
ra
rB
rz
qay
qAy
